<content>
  <section><title>Cool Down (5 minutes)</title>
<title> Student Activity</title>
<para>Draw a tic-tac-toe board on an extra sheet of paper. Use the polynomial functions shown here for the activity.</para>
<para>\(f(x) = 8x^2-6x-2\)<br/>
  \(h(x) = 6x^2-4x-1\)</para>
<para>For each polynomial problem below, place an \(X\) on your tic-tac-toe board corresponding to the location of its matching solution.</para>
<para>\(16x^2-9x^2 =\) ________<br/>
  \((9x^2-5x-3)+(2x^2+8x-3) =\) ________<br/>
  \(f(5) - h(-2) =\) ________<br/>
  \((7x^2-3x+7)-(3x^2+6x-4) =\) ________<br/>
  \(f(4) =\) ________</para>
<para>For each polynomial problem below, place an \(O\) on your tic-tac-toe board corresponding to the location of its matching solution.</para>
<para>\(11x^3+12x^3 =\) ________<br/>
  \(f(x) - h(x) =\) ________<br/>
  \(f(x) + h(x) =\) ________<br/>
  \(h(-3) =\) ________</para>
<para><image height="406" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/e310d0a16f3d61f97baba81e24833db21176e58c" width="414"/></para>
<para>Did the \(Xs\) or \(Os\) win the tic-tac-toe game?</para>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> The \(Xs\) won the game.</para>
<para><image height="410" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/0556198676e4a9a50149f1b5370bdc40d0a2dd91" width="412"/></para>
<para><emphasis>Xs:</emphasis></para>
<para>\(16x^2-9x^2 = 7x^2\)<br/>
  \((9x^2-5x-3)+(2x^2+8x-3) = 11x^2+3x-6\)<br/>
  \(f(5) - h(-2) = 137\)<br/>
  \(f(4) = 102\)<br/>
  \((7x^2-3x+7)-(3x^2+6x-4) = 4x^2-9x+11\)</para>
<para><emphasis>Os:</emphasis></para>
<para>\(11x^3+12x^3 = 23x^3\)<br/>
  \(f(x) - h(x) = 2x^2-2x-1\)<br/>
  \(f(x) + h(x) = 14x^2-10x-3\)<br/>
  \(h(-3) = 65\)</para></section>
</content>
